This repository contains no game assets and no decompiled code. The game is read
at runtime from the user's own installation.

Bevy 0.20 — MIT OR Apache-2.0 (dependency).
  https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy
  Dynamic soft shadows use Bevy's cascaded shadow maps and Gaussian PCF filtering.
  The ACES SDR-reference calibration derives the inverse neutral RRT/ODT fit from
  Bevy's tone mapping shader; no upstream shader is copied.
  See docs/soft-shadows.md.
Performance package resolution: original PC 1.3 upgrade behavior inspected
locally, with dbalatoni13/nfsmw CC0 declarations as a reference.
  https://github.com/dbalatoni13/nfsmw
  Spec-first implementation; no decompiled code or game values copied.

Performance tuning: original PC 1.3 limits, equipment gates, profile retention
and induction/nitrous/cache behavior inspected locally; dbalatoni13/nfsmw CC0
frontend and physics declarations used as references.
  https://github.com/dbalatoni13/nfsmw
  Independent spec-first implementation; no game assets or decompiled code included.

Controller prompt artwork: Kenney Input Prompts 1.5A — CC0 1.0 Universal.
  https://kenney.nl/assets/input-prompts
  https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
  Xbox Series icons are packed into assets/input-prompts/kenney-xbox.png and
  embedded in the executable. See that folder's README.md for source and layout.

