Original PC world material and atmosphere behavior
-----------------------------------------------
The installed PC executable's effect dispatch, embedded D3D9 effects and weather
logic were inspected as behavioral references, without copying original code,
bytecode or assets. Independent synthetic D3D9 shader measurements support the
world/tree/prelit/unfogged, tangent-space normal/specular, reflective scenery,
architectural glass and sky arithmetic. Reflective road and window shaders were
measured independently using synthetic inputs; installed material binding and
weather input logic were inspected separately.
Specifications and provenance:
docs/specs/world-material-routing.md, docs/specs/world-atmosphere.md,
docs/specs/world-sky-shading.md, docs/specs/world-normal-materials.md,
docs/specs/world-reflect-materials.md, docs/specs/world-window-materials.md and their
docs/provenance counterparts.

Original PC car material and lighting behavior
---------------------------------------------
The installed PC executable's car effect selection, material setup and lighting
rig setup were inspected as behavioral references. Synthetic D3D9 measurements
of the original shaders support the independently implemented material equations.
No original bytecode, decompiled code, game assets or mod assets are included.
See docs/specs/car-material-shading.md, docs/specs/car-lighting.md and their
provenance records. Original projected shadow generation remains incomplete.

