PsychoV display tone mapper
--------------------------
RenoDX / PsychoV by Carlos Lopez Jr. (MIT), pinned at
83cf7aa5680c7d4ff078ae7bd845d62a2cc8bdea. The specialized test30 WGSL port retains
the full MIT notice in libs/blackbox-render/src/shaders/psychov/.
See docs/provenance/psychov.md for defaults, conversion and numerical fixtures.
  https://github.com/clshortfuse/renodx
NVIDIA Streamline 2.14.16 integration guidance (MIT-licensed SDK headers and documentation):
https://github.com/NVIDIA-RTX/Streamline
The optional native renderer bridge uses SDK headers supplied separately at build time.
The Reflex, PCL, Frame Generation and separate UI recomposition integration follows
the SDK's corresponding programming guides. Vulkan presentation flow was also
checked against NVIDIA's Apache-2.0 vk_streamline sample:
https://github.com/nvpro-samples/vk_streamline
